section://1A,skin#skin.xur -> section 1A skin skin.xur
SECTION://1a,skin#Upper.png -> section 1A skin Upper.png
section://1A,toolongname#skin.xur -> error section locator section://1A,toolongname#skin.xur is not `section://<module>,<name>#<file>`
section://zz,skin#skin.xur -> error section locator section://zz,skin#skin.xur is not `section://<module>,<name>#<file>`
section://100000000,skin#skin.xur -> error section locator section://100000000,skin#skin.xur is not `section://<module>,<name>#<file>`
file://media:/font.xtt -> file media:/font.xtt
memory://1,2#x -> error locator memory://1,2#x uses the unsupported scheme Memory
http://example/x.png -> error locator http://example/x.png has an unknown scheme
alias://button.png -> section 0 shared button.png
ALIAS://Button.png -> section 0 shared Button.png
icon.png -> section 92000000 scenes icon.png
sub\Image.PNG -> section 92000000 scenes sub\Image.PNG
no base: error relative path scene.xur has no base path to resolve against
